{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>來到日本三大烏冬發源地之一的秋田，必試擁有三百多年歷史的老字號「佐藤養助」。店舖傳承古法熟成技術，拉出的稻庭烏冬扁平細緻，入口滑溜得來帶韌勁。\n</p>\n<p>總店首推「二味せいろ」，一份冷烏冬配上兩款經典蘸汁，分別為清爽的醬油汁，以及濃郁醇厚的芝麻味噌汁。餐牌另有泰式咖喱沾汁選擇。</p>\n<p>店內設有體驗工房，可以隔住玻璃見學職人製作過程。食飽後更能到手信區掃貨，除了乾烏冬，亦能入手樽裝芝麻味噌汁與比內地雞湯汁。</p>\n<p>佐藤養助 總本店<br/>\n📍地址：日本秋田縣湯澤市稻庭町字稻庭80<br/>\n⏰職人製麵參觀時間：11:00 – 16:00<br/>\n🩵留言「秋田」Send秋田餐廳推介List給你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440563589628522_16625646016af4750525c18.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440563589628522_16625646016af4750525c18.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@peggysensei)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dfmbk5FveM6/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac%e7%83%8f%e5%86%ac/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本烏冬</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%a7%8b%e7%94%b0%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">秋田美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%a8%bb%e5%ba%ad%e7%83%8f%e5%86%ac/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稻庭烏冬</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@peggysensei資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dfmbk5FveM6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.895811+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":511,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:50.421236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:51.626660+00:00","content_hash":"0c43822c350899aee1365bcd8a6c333b849ff4fd4e506b2917f850bcc485951f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}